[Term]
id: PREFER:0000001
name: precision fermentation process
def: "A biotechnological method used in industrial or research settings that employs genetically engineered or adaptatively evolved(ALE) microorganisms (such as bacteria, yeast, fungi or microalgae) to produce specific, high-value compounds with precise molecular structures. This process involves controlled environments—such as operating bioreactor parameters(e.g., temperature, pH, dissolved oxygen, agitation, nutrient feed) and upstream preparation conditions(e.g., pre-culture growth, strain storage, and defined media composition)—where microbial metabolism is optimized to synthesize target products, such as proteins, enzymes, or bioactive molecules, often with greater efficiency, yield, and specificity than traditional fermentation methods." [PREFER]
comment: "Root of all fermentation terms in the Precision Fermentation Ontology."
xref: GO:0006113
xref: OBI_0000011
xref: SRAO_/SRAO:0000223
xref: Wikipedia:Industrial_fermentation#Precision_fermentation
is_a: SIO:000000 ! entity
relationship: has_part PREFER:0000002 ! fermentation project

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000002
name: fermentation project
def: "A single fermentation experiment or multiple related experiments conducted within a research group." [PREFER]
synonym: "project" EXACT []
xref: OBI_0000066
is_a: PREFER:0000001 ! precision fermentation process
relationship: has_part PREFER:0000003 ! fermentation experiment

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000003
name: fermentation experiment
def: "A set of fermentation runs conducted within the same project, all following a shared experimental approach or protocol." [PREFER]
synonym: "experiment" EXACT []
xref: OBI_0000070
is_a: PREFER:0000002 ! fermentation project
relationship: has_part PREFER:0000004 ! fermentation run

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000004
name: fermentation run
def: "An individual instance of a precision fermentation process carried out under defined experimental conditions (e.g., temperature, pH, agitation) using a single bioreactor system." [PREFER]
synonym: "run" EXACT []
xref: CHMO:0001624
is_a: PREFER:0000003 ! fermentation experiment
relationship: cultures_cell PREFER:0000012 ! cell biocatalyst
relationship: has_collected PREFER:0000018 ! offline sample
relationship: has_cultivation_condition PREFER:0000008 ! cultivation condition
relationship: has_measured_compound CHEBI:24431 ! chemical entity
relationship: has_measured_process_variable PREFER:0000009 ! process variable
relationship: has_medium PREFER:0000011 ! medium
relationship: part_of PREFER:0000003 ! fermentation experiment
relationship: PREFER_RE:has_cultivation_condition PREFER:0000008 ! cultivation condition
relationship: PREFER_RE:has_measured_process_variable PREFER:0000009 ! process variable
relationship: PREFER_RE:has_medium PREFER:0000011 ! medium
