relationship: refers_to_variable PREFER:0000033 ! DO
relationship: setpoint_of PREFER:0000039 ! DO measurement

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000026
name: DO cascade level
def: "The cascade control system for dissolved oxygen linked to a parameter to achieve the desired DO level." [PREFER]
comment: "For instance, in fed-batch operation mode there could be three different cascade levels. Level 1 involves adjusting the stirrer speed parameter. Level 2 involves adjusting the air flow parameter. Level 3 involves adjusting the oxygen flow parameter." [PREFER]
synonym: "dissolved oxygen cascade control strategy" EXACT []
synonym: "DO control cascade level" EXACT []
is_a: SIO:000000 ! entity
relationship: refers_to_variable PREFER:0000033 ! DO

