relationship: has_unit QUDT:PER-HR

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000078
name: carbon balance
def: "Balance which compares the total amount of carbon entering the fermenter (through the substrate) to the total carbon leaving the fermenter (in products, biomass or by-products like CO2)." [PREFER]
synonym: "C balance" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000158 ! respiratory metric
relationship: has_unit UO:0000187 ! percent

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000079
name: carbon balance using carbon mols
def: "The carbon balance calculated using carbon moles (c-mols), providing more molecular level view of the carbon flow." [PREFER]
synonym: "C balance (c-mols)" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000158 ! respiratory metric
relationship: has_unit UO:0000189 ! count unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000080
name: carbon balance with reference to substrate
def: "The carbon balance specifically referenced to the substrate usedin the bioprocess, to asses substrate utilization efficiency." [PREFER]
synonym: "carbon balance to substrate" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000158 ! respiratory metric
relationship: has_unit UO:0000189 ! count unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000081
name: degree of reduction balance
def: "Balance that quantifies the redox state in a bioprocess by ensuring that the total electrons entering the system are equal to those leaving it, reflecting electron conservation." [PREFER]
synonym: "DoR balance" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000156 ! yield
relationship: has_unit UO:0000187 ! percent

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000082
name: degree of reduction yields
def: "The degree of reduction calculated based on the yields of different products. This helps understand how efficiently the system is converting substrate into desired products, taking into account the redox state of each component." [PREFER]
synonym: "DoR yields" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000156 ! yield
relationship: has_unit UO:0000189 ! count unit

